<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Nuclear Storm, 1991</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;The use of nuclear weapons in the Persian Gulf War was thankfully never seriously considered, and the main belief was that their main role was as a deterrent to prevent Saddam from using chemical weapons of his own against coalition forces. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;In this timeline, this was not the case. Hundreds of coalition personnel have&amp;nbsp;been killed and maimed by a chemical-loaded rocket, and now a retaliation is in order-to illustrate within limits that some lines are not to be crossed. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-Scenario by Coiler12&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
